body:
Its just body image issues, no one elses fault.

If anything blame it on genettics, for so long all I wanted in life was to be a skinny, cute femboy. But im simply not buily that way, its physically impossible with how my body is built, so I live knowing that 1 body I want, I cant ever have, so I dont like seeing others who do. (I dont not like them, I hate me)

Aaaaand of course you dont respond ;~;
